{
  "$comment": "Canonical catalog of node types known to the editor, version 1. Type identifiers must match WorkflowDefinition.NODE_TYPE_PATTERN. Handles are the connection points an edge's sourceHandle/targetHandle may reference. The frontend registry (frontend/src/features/editor/nodeTypes.ts) is tested against this file; the backend node registry (later module) must implement exactly these types. Each node type's configuration schema is $defs/<type> in node-config.v1.schema.json. defaultConfiguration is what a newly created node starts with; it may be incomplete (invalid) on purpose, and is completed by the user before the workflow is activated. role: 'trigger' nodes start a workflow (no inputs; exactly one per workflow); 'action' nodes run when reached.",
